 "source_instruction": "i need a toasted brown wig that is made from natural hair.",
 "query": "Ugh, I swear the bus ride over here was wild today\u2014there was a golden retriever in a tiny knit pumpkin costume trotting down the aisle like he owned the place, and he stopped to nudge every single passenger\u2019s hand for pets before curling up at the feet of the guy holding a full tray of iced lattes. The barista at the corner shop I stopped at right before coming in remembered my order from three weeks ago, even added the extra dash of cinnamon I\u2019d mentioned liking offhand last time I was there, and didn\u2019t even charge me for the oat milk upgrade. I almost tripped over a stack of those little fall-themed decorative gourds they set out by the front entrance too, they were so perfectly glossy and orange I didn\u2019t even see them until my shoe was half an inch from knocking a whole pile over. Hey, can you help me find a wig in this section? I need one made of yak hair, my budget is $380 max, and make sure it comes with a free satin storage bag too. Oh, and grab me that one shade I always pick, yeah? I don\u2019t wanna have to sift through a ton of options to find the right fit.",
